<title>THAILAND: Thai Reinsurance to pay 4.00 baht div.</title>
<headline>Thai Reinsurance to pay 4.00 baht div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  4.00    vs    4.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 11, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 8, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Thai Reinsurance Plc, an insurance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
